  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">Railway RRB Group D Admit Card 2026</h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-08-18T11:14:40+05:30\">August 18, 2026</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">11:14 am</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://indianrailways.gov.in/\">Railway Recruitment Boards (RRB)</a>,</strong> has released the <b>Exam City / Admit Card</b>\u00a0on its <strong>official website\u00a0</strong>for the recruitment of <strong>Group-D (Level-1) posts across various railway zones in India.</strong> The\u00a0<strong>exam</strong> will be conducted on <strong>03, 06, 09, 17, 21 &amp; 25 August 2026.</strong>\u00a0and the\u00a0<strong>last date</strong>\u00a0to submit the application form was\u00a0<strong>09 March 2026.</strong>\u00a0Candidates can also check their\u00a0<strong>Admit Card</strong>\u00a0by using their\u00a0<strong>Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>\u00a0by logging into the\u00a0<strong>portal.\u00a0The\u00a0direct link</strong>\u00a0is provided below.\u00a0<strong>(<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Advt. No. CEN 09/2025</span>)</strong></span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><style>\n        .social-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n        .social-button {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: cent